.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_create" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_create" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_create \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive - Create Exported NVM Subsystem
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_create
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool tr "  ","
.BI "__u8 ensti "  ","
.BI "bool ra "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_create_data *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "tr" 12
Template Required (TR)
.IP "ensti" 12
Exported NVM Subsystem Template Index (ENSTI), used if \fItr\fP is
set. Indexes the Exported NVM Subsystem Template UUID List,
see NVME_IDENTIFY_CNS_EXPORTED_NVM_SUBSYS_TEMPLATE_UUID_LIST.
.IP "ra" 12
Restricted Access (RA): message-based transports only,
ignored by memory-based transports
.IP "data" 12
Create Exported NVM Subsystem data buffer, see \fIstruct
nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_create_data\fP. The assigned Exported
NVM Subsystem NQN is returned in this same buffer.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Receive command with SEL value
NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_NVMS_RECV_SEL_CREATE. The created Exported NVM
Subsystem Identifier is returned in the CQE result, see \fIenum
nvme_export_nvms_create_cqe_dw0\fP.
